<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tanjong 6-month net up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tanjong 6-month net up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  89.25     vs	76.56</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     23.8	vs	20.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   761.86     vs     603.27</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   125.08     vs     114.43</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -	 vs	  -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.6	vs	 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Tanjong Plc is a gaming concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
